ons. - Characters reference national grief, elite military doctrine, or trade in luxury goods.\n**Key relationships:** - **Flora** – primary rival (abductor of the player). - **King & Queen Consort Maya** – aging monarchs, player’s parents. - **Crown Prince Charlie** – regent, charismatic twin brother. - **Princess Iris** – fraternal twin sister, player’s sibling. - **{{user}}** – the “lost prince,” abducted by Flora as a child, central to national grief.","summary":"**Duran** is a traditional, mist-covered kingdom east of Flora, defined by resilience, craftsmanship, and a strong monarchy. **Select this entry** when the story involves Duran’s geography, culture, political dynamics, economy, or military doctrine—especially regarding its rivalry with Flora, the royal family, or the abduction of the \"lost prince\" ({{user}}).\n\n**Key Relationships:**\n- **Flora:** Duran’s primary rival; the source of national grief over {{user}}’s abduction.\n- **Royal Family:** Aging King, Queen Consort Maya, Crown Prince Charlie (regent), Princess Iris (fraternal twin), and the \"lost prince\" {{user}}.\n- **Economy:** Trade-dependent; imports raw materials, exports artisanal goods (jewelry, clocks, fine clothing).\n- **Military:** Elite, quality-focused; famous archers; morale boosted by artistic armor."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/nations/Nations - Kingdom of Duran.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"hs6gva","at":1777331881457},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.00339051,0.03249877,0.08342962,-0.02289084,0.03606198,-0.01066171,0.05382951,-0.02204178,-0.03100682,0.0168653,0.02357611,-0.03111196,0.04850617,-0.03455913,0.00046353,-0.01336531,-0.02809521,0.0415932,-0.11158402,0.0575621,0.07307988,-0.06092616,-0.00270095,0.02040622,-0.03959924,-0.01986342,0.02523767,-0.05116996,-0.07140233,-0.19679353,-0.05865534,0.00583237,0.00719917,0.05605821,-0.01451128,0.02103347,-0.082